# Impossible arm (log 2026-07-31): the target-lottery exploit. The AI picks
# every attack target uniformly at random over ALL our units with no fog
# term (a.java:1726) -- our placement is the distribution of its attacks.
# Five scouts posted on empty flanks are five tickets: every wave that
# draws one crosses extra map, chases a unit that flees it, and spends its
# five-hundred-tick commitment on ground we never needed.

name scatter
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 3
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
kite 0
tech 1
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 0
medics 0
decoys 5
